Crow bit me again.

179
00:06:16,343 --> 00:06:17,978
(all laugh)

180
00:06:18,012 --> 00:06:18,645
Mmhmm.

181
00:06:19,347 --> 00:06:21,482
And finally, is this right?

182
00:06:21,515 --> 00:06:24,483
Red one, your test score
shows you missed only one

183
