187
00:06:34,027 --> 00:06:34,862
Oh, that...

188
00:06:36,063 --> 00:06:36,863
Oh, well,

189
00:06:36,897 --> 00:06:37,463
well, well,

190
00:06:37,497 --> 00:06:38,665
well, well, well, I...

191
