- Upon you.

247
00:08:53,333 --> 00:08:57,237
(laughs evilly)
(Servo chuckles)

248
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:59,007
- Brava.
- Bravo.

249
00:09:02,708 --> 00:09:05,045
Wow, I've got a mole
hair thicker than her waist.

250
00:09:05,078 --> 00:09:07,347
