devoid of internal organs.

251
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:10,585
I can still feel into the
dress I wore at my baptism.

252
00:09:11,618 --> 00:09:12,752
She better not
breathe too hard,

253
00:09:12,785 --> 00:09:15,555
